{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>mo.Days 是一款以照片、顏色與單句記錄每天的日記 App，適合喜歡輕量紀錄生活、整理回憶與保留當下氣氛的人。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-14.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>用顏色照片濃縮每一天</h2>\n<p>開啟 mo.Days 便能看到當天卡片，選擇顏色會滲入照片，成為那天氛圍；再寫一句話，左右滑動即可回到昨天或去年同日。記錄可加入時間、地點、同行者與氣溫，地點可保留自訂名稱。鎖定畫面一鍵捕捉片段，晚間以問答完成回顧，並可透過人物、地點、標籤搜尋，將私密紀錄隱藏而不留痕跡。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-21-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-22-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-23-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-24-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-25-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-26-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：mo.Days</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/mo-days/id6817686720?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:49.848126+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":270,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T07:50:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:10.278339+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:10.278339+00:00","content_hash":"d14599368d2c96b4e49581aebb1b2e991c4d5b8d47a7707aea6f296cbde27efb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}